  "sourceText": "Thai Coleslaw\nBy: Kitch-N-Chik\nPublished: Sunday, February 14, 2010 - 2:18am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 head green cabbage, shredded\n1 head red cabbage, shredded\n4 Green onion, sliced\n1 Jalapeno pepper, seeded and diced\n1 cup Cilantro, chopped\n1 Cucumber, seeded and chopped\n1 Red pepper, chopped\n1 cup Peanuts, chopped\n1 cup Oil\n1 cup Rice wine vinegar\n1 teaspoon Curry powder\n2 tablespoons Sugar\n2 Garlic cloves, crushed\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all of the ingredients for salad together in a large bowl. Whisk dressing ingredients together and toss with salad when ready to serve.",
